# .env.local IS committed on purpose: it only holds the public half of the pinned dev
# signing key (WXT_EXTENSION_DEV_KEY) so the extension gets the same chrome-extension://
# id on every machine that builds this repo, matching passwd-server's EXTENSION_ORIGIN
# without per-device reconfiguration. Not secret — the same value ends up in every
# built manifest.json anyway.
